<title>USA: Saratoga Beverage discussing merger.</title>
<headline>Saratoga Beverage discussing merger.</headline>
<dateline>SARATOGA SPRINGS, N.Y. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saratoga Beverage Group Inc said Tuesday it had begun talks with HYPE Beverage Corp about a possible merger or &quot;business combination&quot;.</p>
<p>It did not elaborate.</p>
<p>Saratoga makes sparkling and non-carbonated spring water. HYPE makes vitamin-enhanced energy drinks that are distributed to more than 20 countries.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
